			(value "2x20 hdr, Pi ribbon")
			(footprint "diffsmart:PiRibbon_2x20_P2.54mm")
			(description "2x20 2.54 mm MALE header for a 40-way ribbon to a Raspberry Pi. The Pi is not part of the assembly and JLCPCB does not supply it. Pin numbering is straight through, so a standard ribbon maps board pin n to Pi pin n - watch the pin 1 marker, because a plain header can be plugged on either way round and reversed puts 5 V on GPIO2. The same holes take a shrouded DC3-40P box header if you would rather have the key; there is clearance for the shroud")
			(fields
				(field
					(name "LCSC") "C50980")
				(field
